<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - C.R. Bard raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - C.R. Bard raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded C.R. Bard Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday, C.R. Bard said it may take a one-time charge for a reorganization.</p>
<p>-- C.R. Bard gained 1-7/8 to 35-1/2.</p>
</text>
